# 🚨 Air Alert System (Real-time Alert System)

This is a simple real-time web application built with **Node.js + Express + Socket.IO** that allows toggling an “air alert” state for all connected users in real time.

The project is deployed on Render.

---

## ⚙️ Features

- 🔴 Activate air alert in real time  
- 🟢 Deactivate alert (all-clear state)  
- 🔐 Simple admin authentication via admin key  
- 🌐 Real-time updates using WebSockets (Socket.IO)  
- 🔊 Optional alarm sound for users  
- 📡 Works online via deployment (Render)

---

## 🧱 Technologies Used

- Node.js  
- Express.js  
- Socket.IO  
- HTML  
- CSS  
- JavaScript  

---

